stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observe
    Observe --> ValidateState
    ValidateState --> Fallback: stale, incomplete or out-of-domain data
    ValidateState --> Forecast: state passes data controls
    Forecast --> Simulate: approved scenario set
    Simulate --> FeasibilityGate: candidate policy and baseline comparison
    FeasibilityGate --> Fallback: limit, mandate or operational breach
    FeasibilityGate --> HumanReview: feasible recommendation with uncertainty
    HumanReview --> Fallback: reject, insufficient evidence or trigger activated
    HumanReview --> Execute: authorized approval
    Execute --> Monitor: trade, funding or pricing action settles
    Monitor --> Review: realized outcomes and new observations
    Review --> Observe: regular review cycle
    Review --> Fallback: material model drift or incident
    Fallback --> Observe: approved contingency action and fresh state
